   55: push_constant_string "To modify the spell so that it goes to our chosen destination, you must connect the "
   56: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   57: push_constant_string "start node"
   58: push_constant_string "</col>"
   59: push_constant_string " at the bottom to the "
   60: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   61: push_constant_string "destination node"
   62: push_constant_string "</col>"
   63: push_constant_string " in the "
   64: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   65: push_constant_string "upper half"
   66: push_constant_string "</col>"
   67: push_constant_string " of the tablet."
   68: push_constant_string "<br>"
   69: push_constant_string "<br>"
   70: push_constant_string "Drag the "
   71: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   72: push_constant_string "conduit tiles"
   73: push_constant_string "</col>"
   74: push_constant_string " into the grid to form a path leading upwards. You can click tiles to remove them from the grid."
   75: push_constant_string "<br>"
   76: push_constant_string "<br>"
   77: push_constant_string "The tablet has been damaged slightly by the chipping process, creating "
   78: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   79: push_constant_string "dead zones"
   80: push_constant_string "</col>"
   81: push_constant_string ". Magic cannot flow through a "
   82: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
   83: push_constant_string "dead zone"
   84: push_constant_string "</col>"
   85: push_constant_string ", so you must route the power around them."
